  1. INVOICE / QUOTE / ESTIMATE CREATION
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
  • Create documents of three types: Invoice, Quote, or Estimate
  • Add line items — each with name, quantity, unit price, and note
  • Add a client (new or from saved list) directly on creation
  • Set Invoice Date and Due Date
  • Add a discount (fixed amount) at invoice level
  • Add Tax with a custom label (e.g. GST, VAT) and rate (%)
  • Track a Received Amount — balance due is auto-calculated
  • Add internal Notes shown on the PDF
  • Attach Terms & Conditions (default from Settings, overridable)
  • Attach Bank / Payment Details to every invoice
  • Set document status: Paid or Unpaid
  • Custom invoice number — editable prefix + auto-incrementing counter
  • Edit any existing invoice / quote / estimate at any time
  • Delete invoices
  • Convert a Quote or Estimate into a full Invoice in one tap

